      "uid": "zhcn:82a00cc778224400164d1ff9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想让训练员跟在自己身后走",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ac501ad0b51cfac85185190c9c3ea20ce5c90a2ca4cfbf01bf3726c6f2da564",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c52438798b4b2e030244193c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "亲吻爸爸和妈妈和姐妹们的照片！",
      "source_fingerprint": "533bf029df35fe48712ed901b9bb3d3301572aba8680fadc9019e8b112e74b6f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a01c77dde534e7049e08704",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将比赛中所有对手的名字在心中默念一遍",
      "source_fingerprint": "78969bd8fc7571fca67b1cd8ffd70432784ec26823c7f1556f21c85f80dde6da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5b7b1c574b570e3bbb3c4d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从宿舍学生和后辈那里得到温暖的鼓励",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2a02ded7c55180b4ce4d26c59ea82956a18986bc706a90f4164a30acd5ae922",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c78d430ff192019d76bcfa43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "测体温以确认身体情况，是从小养成的习惯",
      "source_fingerprint": "f54f4b177ad3d449b3e7db674162c2cd4bee98747ea845d149f7e6dd0aca44a1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcf0463885bc69cf6acfdb0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将披风帅气甩下，然后自己捡起来",
      "source_fingerprint": "17384a56088a74856ac27dfdc481005d9c2457426af7e3f3e195f4409f296a50",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f282cc84a2f2a3367d33a643",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一个个地确认观众们的表情",
      "source_fingerprint": "91472b67ed71d9c54d270f4c85d8d412eb81314da962cd441abbd84b886de2c0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92718264121492c0c2d65a6d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "更换鼻子上的胶布",
      "source_fingerprint": "a56979e6fd03847c1e7467380f6eb0e25a3b0c5ac136da77bca976ea56b2c389",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb5ae480677139e451a20588",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让出道路即可",
      "source_fingerprint": "87e64d6634a070e6b76580ec2349dd2fb8d686dc4ab0473f1f62b69e57dc0bef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb56207d1e57d0fe92e4ea6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "重涂眼影，鼓足干劲",
      "source_fingerprint": "e29f84d1960e2da81bd7f5215fd355d874f3302743c6f4f93fefd7357dde5dcc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0d84f07ab162786eae07005",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "心情激动！！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d33d80174eb6645aaa9cac1eda304967c36d43bf243b3cc85431f9d13b6b78db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97812ce88e6b13ebaa635bb1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "“您请您请”这样地让对手先入闸",
      "source_fingerprint": "883775f2d5f9014e15eda5349f88de957e885e142deacac5580644b3f2107ac8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:495f6c5804cdcc9d7d8e2f80",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总感觉产生的静电变多了",
      "source_fingerprint": "06edec917205becf064bb71de566d8fc6ea8d4b31a9dfcb632bdb4d3b5d8c694",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:926bdbdd6e1ede76e27e7d54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对一起奔跑的赛马娘们『请安』",
      "source_fingerprint": "f338c09565a9d6f5b6f361b29bcf1b12cf0add5a5f79cc25cb1c55f8a0f537b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8579502fbcac78da06faa9c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "关于参赛的赛马娘们的情报就连喜欢的东西都要知晓",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ec58fd345787a414b4e8dd4f3160b95049427ab3b003535d3123b0d4ebda74f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:093cd68df2bbc9bf8faebc8f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "锁定训练员在观战席的位置☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f73b6f6e6e4ec3bcf54cb4d0ad16acdc571f0fe975bc2534181d535d06ece3dd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d53e8b953f28d18be1854e7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "闭上眼睛想象黑夜",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0e3bdc0a1328f4611889ce3988a120847839c4f39d97f47a296c9766a6fc424",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db780597bbc56914c17ac2da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用眼睛、耳朵与皮肤来测量赛场的湿度、气温和风向",
      "source_fingerprint": "1834207c880b4e547b8d092515245e6fd045f883efefefe8f46b6aed465098de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ef8640372726026ebe3d9a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的肌肉是最强的！像这样鼓励自己",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2601c51dc757ba20d763482930d078a543105cc08feac2ce2790580ff0f3d69",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:737e810d8b27da7ce251d963",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向妈妈要求用甜点作为奖励！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba62aea5f604def229ab99a23d1f5b0c204f0a2314f792fa657f78b0e9eee87e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8baa53c840a6c0b0285608d5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "认真整理头发和面罩",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0b20ab9acccf588e4a3f0bcb6261a6b18abf0187c92702a76ac78f3275c2709",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aebf7cd5b982c2451695060",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在伸展运动上花的时间比别人多上一倍",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba04a0863ad7abb0cdcb946d87f33e781a7c63f7ac140f40394de1b5ade3c18",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c97d108fe7bbaa825e3dcd17",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进休息室前嚼口香糖提高注意力",
      "source_fingerprint": "450ba9d7fe6c8719be421efb09451ae5ff2a4b6d834379169ac3f71c43c2d488",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78e95faf3b67e72c2251e83e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "确认温度、湿度、体温、天气和风向",
      "source_fingerprint": "677b3b8320c732e06cae4f8622a5756c3362f4ac8c7ba3714f8020d769369bd8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:577e46d23f888cdc1c30482d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "握紧拳头到有点疼，以注入干劲",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc7f56fb0ad0d8941420698fddab272999af6fe73fd5409b531467d934f33423",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07a602d25850623561021199",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "前一晚先洗澡以鼓起干劲",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecd63b103f9eeb53b479f65da70bb8a5253d1d9cf13d8d9081109e34388ac291",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb2ffd260f1a69fdbd6a7992",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "回看过去德比的比赛录像来鼓起干劲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87424940fceae4b839384cf45113064c7a7ca988d2974d77fa8476428a6163f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75d4e8d7685740f38996ceee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "沉思，叫她的话反应很慢",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a98f2fe6eeaeac166ff075539d40b869953042b5fa4a4ee8ddcd250343c0f27",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:484643f68dd83ba2f8defadd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成为其他出场赛马娘的人肉时钟",
      "source_fingerprint": "b11e59edfe9472ae970ab61548d1c7b012d28e2e18337120b84a090eca734d12",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ac57823d030c71dd8064f52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "离开等候室前会重新检查一遍可爱度和蹄铁",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bfd506fc5e899e4ca3b7cf33640a6ede31eea962f02badd6b496a6196270594",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5891fbd286ba1a3d5e4ae231",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "打正拳来鼓起干劲",
      "source_fingerprint": "60a2b1858b1644acd0c746d8a01e23804713abd55478bf65eb798ef1b4009078",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1039"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
